    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "zYdTyGfYRQVG"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Deep Q-Network (DQN)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "iRSnvqy6RQVG"
      },
      "source": [
        "Implement the Deep Q algorithm. We have studied about DQN algorithm in the Lecture. Use the function definitions (given below).\n",
        "\n",
        "This class implements the DQN Agent, you are required to implement the various methods of this class\n",
        "as outlined below. Note this class is generic and should work with any permissible Gym environment\n",
        "\n",
        "You may also add extra helper classes if required.\n",
        "\n",
        "You must test your implementation on both Gym environments. In the submitted Colab notebook, demonstrate the training for both environments using at least one random seed\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "class DQN():\n",
        "    def __init__(env, seed, gamma,\n",
        "                 bufferSize,\n",
        "                 batchSize,\n",
        "                 optimizerFn,\n",
        "                 optimizerLR,\n",
        "                 MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES, MAX_EVAL_EPISODES,\n",
        "                 explorationStrategyTrainFn,\n",
        "                 explorationStrategyEvalFn,\n",
        "                 updateFrequency)\n",
        "    def initBookKeeping(self)\n",
        "    def performBookKeeping(self, train = True)\n",
        "    def runDQN(self)\n",
        "    def trainAgent(self)\n",
        "    def trainNetwork(self, experiences)\n",
        "    def updateNetwork(self, onlineNet, targetNet)\n",
        "    def evaluateAgent(self)\n",
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "bLaDUiUWRQVG"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class DQN():\n",
        "    def __init__(self, env, seed, gamma,\n",
        "                 bufferSize,\n",
        "                 batchSize,\n",
        "                 optimizerFn,\n",
        "                 optimizerLR,\n",
        "                 MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES, MAX_EVAL_EPISODES,\n",
        "                 explorationStrategyTrainFn,\n",
        "                 explorationStrategyEvalFn,\n",
        "                 updateFrequency):\n",
        "        #this DQN method\n",
        "        # 1. creates and initializes (with seed) the environment, train/eval episodes, gamma, etc.\n",
        "        # 2. creates and intializes all the variables required for book-keeping values via the initBookKeeping method\n",
        "        # 3. creates traget and online Q-networks using the createValueNetwork above\n",
        "        # 4. creates and initializes (with network params) the optimizer function\n",
        "        # 5. sets the explorationStartegy variables/functions for train and evaluation\n",
        "        # 6. sets the batchSize for the number of experiences\n",
        "        # 7. Creates the replayBuffer\n",
        "        #Your code goes in here\n",
        "        self.env = env\n",
        "        self.gamma = gamma\n",
        "        self.batchSize = batchSize\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES = MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES\n",
        "        self.MAX_EVAL_EPISODES = MAX_EVAL_EPISODES\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.explorationStrategyTrainFn = explorationStrategyTrainFn\n",
        "        self.explorationStrategyEvalFn = explorationStrategyEvalFn\n",
        "        self.updateFrequency = updateFrequency\n",
        "\n",
        "        env.reset(seed = seed)\n",
        "        np.random.seed(seed)\n",
        "        torch.manual_seed(seed)\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.onlineNet = createValueNetwork(env.observation_space.shape[0], env.action_space.n,hDim=[512,256])\n",
        "        self.targetNet = createValueNetwork(env.observation_space.shape[0], env.action_space.n,hDim = [512,256])\n",
        "        self.targetNet.load_state_dict(self.onlineNet.state_dict())\n",
        "        for param in self.targetNet.parameters():\n",
        "            param.requires_grad = False\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.optimizer = optimizerFn(self.onlineNet.parameters(), lr = optimizerLR)\n",
        "        self.replayBuffer = ReplayBuffer(bufferSize,bufferType = 'DQN')\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.initBookKeeping()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "rzfYqAyARQVG"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class DQN(DQN):\n",
        "    def initBookKeeping(self):\n",
        "        #this method creates and intializes all the variables required for book-keeping values and it is called\n",
        "        #init method\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        # Your code goes in here\n",
        "        self.trainRewardsList     = []\n",
        "        self.evalRewardsList      = []\n",
        "        self.trainTimeList        = []\n",
        "        self.wallClockTimeList    = []\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.episodeReward        = 0\n",
        "        self.episodeTrainTime     = 0\n",
        "        self.evalReward           = 0\n",
        "        self.accumulatedTrainTime = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "        return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "-2BoWQGORQVG"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class DQN(DQN):\n",
        "    def performBookKeeping(self, train = True):\n",
        "        #this method updates relevant variables for the bookKeeping, this can be called\n",
        "        #multiple times during training\n",
        "        #if you want you can print information using this, so it may help to monitor progress and also help to debug\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        # Your code goes in here\n",
        "        if train == True:\n",
        "            self.accumulatedTrainTime += self.episodeTrainTime\n",
        "            self.trainRewardsList.append(self.episodeReward)\n",
        "            self.trainTimeList.append(self.accumulatedTrainTime)\n",
        "\n",
        "            wallClockTime = time.time() - self.trainStartTime\n",
        "            self.wallClockTimeList.append(wallClockTime)\n",
        "\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            self.evalRewardsList.append(self.evalReward)\n",
        "\n",
        "        return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "BEYOseY3RQVH"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class DQN(DQN):\n",
        "    def runDQN(self):\n",
        "        #this is the main method, it trains the agent, performs bookkeeping while training and finally evaluates\n",
        "        #the agent and returns the following quantities:\n",
        "        #1. episode wise mean train rewards\n",
        "        #2. epsiode wise mean eval rewards\n",
        "        #2. episode wise trainTime (in seconds): time elapsed during training since the start of the first episode\n",
        "        #3. episode wise wallClockTime (in seconds): actual time elapsed since the start of training,\n",
        "        #                               note this will include time for BookKeeping and evaluation\n",
        "        # Note both trainTime and wallClockTime get accumulated as episodes proceed.\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        #Your code goes in here\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        self.trainRewardsList, self.trainTimeList, self.evalRewardsList, self.wallClockTimeList  = self.trainAgent()\n",
        "        finalEvalReward = np.mean(self.evaluateAgent())\n",
        "\n",
        "        return self.trainRewardsList, self.trainTimeList, self.evalRewardsList, self.wallClockTimeList, finalEvalReward"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7e1dQk7kDEVs"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class DQN(DQN):\n",
        "    def trainAgent(self):\n",
        "        #this method collects experiences and trains the agent and does BookKeeping while training.\n",
        "        #this calls the trainNetwork() method internally, it also evaluates the agent per episode\n",
        "        #it trains the agent for MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        self.initBookKeeping()\n",
        "        self.trainStartTime = time.time()\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.updateNetwork(self.onlineNet, self.targetNet)\n",
        "\n",
        "        for episode in range(self.MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES):\n",
        "\n",
        "            state, done = self.env.reset()\n",
        "\n",
        "            self.episodeReward = 0\n",
        "            self.episodeTrainTime = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "            self.replayBuffer.collectExperiences(\n",
        "                self.env, state, self.explorationStrategyTrainFn,\n",
        "                countExperiences=50000, net=self.onlineNet\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "            self.episodeReward = self.replayBuffer.lastEpisodeReward  # ← clean fix\n",
        "\n",
        "            trainStart = time.time()\n",
        "\n",
        "            if self.replayBuffer.length() >= self.batchSize:\n",
        "                experiences = self.replayBuffer.sample(self.batchSize)\n",
        "                self.trainNetwork(experiences, epochs=10)\n",
        "\n",
        "            self.episodeTrainTime += time.time() - trainStart\n",
        "\n",
        "            self.performBookKeeping(train=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "            self.evalReward = np.mean(self.evaluateAgent())\n",
        "            self.performBookKeeping(train=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "            if hasattr(self.explorationStrategyTrainFn, 'decay'):\n",
        "                self.explorationStrategyTrainFn.decay()\n",
        "\n",
        "            if episode % self.updateFrequency == 0:\n",
        "                self.updateNetwork(self.onlineNet, self.targetNet)\n",
        "\n",
        "            if (episode + 1) % 50 == 0:\n",
        "\n",
        "              self.evalReward = np.mean(self.evaluateAgent())\n",
        "              print(\n",
        "                  f\"Episode {episode+1} | \"\n",
        "                  f\"Train {np.mean(self.trainRewardsList[-10:]):.2f} | \"\n",
        "                  f\"Eval {self.evalReward:.2f} | \"\n",
        "                  f\"Eps {self.explorationStrategyTrainFn.get_epsilon():.3f}\"\n",
        "              )\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "        return self.trainRewardsList, self.trainTimeList, self.evalRewardsList, self.wallClockTimeList"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "OSjFYKyORQVH"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class DQN(DQN):\n",
        "    def trainNetwork(self, experiences, epochs):\n",
        "        # this method trains the value network epoch number of times and is called by the trainAgent function\n",
        "        # it essentially uses the experiences to calculate target, using the targets it calculates the error, which\n",
        "        # is further used for calulating the loss. It then uses the optimizer over the loss\n",
        "        # to update the params of the network by backpropagating through the network\n",
        "        # this function does not return anything\n",
        "        # you can try out other loss functions other than MSE like Huber loss, MAE, etc.\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        #Your code goes in here\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        states, actions, rewards, next_states, dones = self.replayBuffer.splitExperiences(experiences)\n",
        "\n",
        "        states      = torch.FloatTensor(states)\n",
        "        actions     = torch.LongTensor(actions)\n",
        "        rewards     = torch.FloatTensor(rewards)\n",
        "        next_states = torch.FloatTensor(next_states)\n",
        "        dones       = torch.FloatTensor(dones)\n",
        "\n",
        "        for epoch in range(epochs):\n",
        "            #Calculates Targets\n",
        "            max_next_q = self.targetNet(next_states).detach().max(dim=1).values\n",
        "            tdTargets  = rewards + self.gamma * max_next_q * (1 - dones)\n",
        "\n",
        "            #prediction using onlineNet\n",
        "            predicted_q_all = self.onlineNet(states)\n",
        "            qs = predicted_q_all.gather(1, actions.unsqueeze(1)).squeeze(1)\n",
        "\n",
        "            #error calculation:\n",
        "            tdErrors = tdTargets - qs\n",
        "\n",
        "            #MSE LOSS\n",
        "            loss = torch.mean(0.5 * (tdErrors ** 2))\n",
        "            #HuberLoss:\n",
        "            #loss = huberLoss(tdErrors, delta)\n",
        "\n",
        "            #Backpropogation\n",
        "            self.optimizer.zero_grad()\n",
        "            loss.backward()\n",
        "            self.optimizer.step()\n",
        "\n",
        "        return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "vYWbMcUzRQVH"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class DQN(DQN):\n",
        "    def updateNetwork(self, onlineNet, targetNet):\n",
        "        #this function updates the onlineNetwork with the target network\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        # Your code goes in here\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        targetNet.load_state_dict(onlineNet.state_dict())\n",
        "        return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "doSMBXMeRQVH"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class DQN(DQN):\n",
        "    def evaluateAgent(self):\n",
        "        #this function evaluates the agent using the value network, it evaluates agent for MAX_EVAL_EPISODES\n",
        "        #typcially MAX_EVAL_EPISODES = 1\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        #Your code goes in here\n",
        "        #\n",
        "        finalEvalRewardsList = []\n",
        "        for e in range(self.MAX_EVAL_EPISODES):\n",
        "            rs = 0\n",
        "            state, done = self.env.reset()\n",
        "            while True:\n",
        "                if callable(self.explorationStrategyEvalFn):\n",
        "                    action = self.explorationStrategyEvalFn(self.onlineNet, state)\n",
        "                else:\n",
        "                    action = self.explorationStrategyEvalFn.selectAction(self.onlineNet, state)\n",
        "                next_state, r, terminated, truncated, info = self.env.step(action)\n",
        "                done = terminated or truncated\n",
        "                rs    += r\n",
        "                state  = next_state\n",
        "                if done:\n",
        "                    finalEvalRewardsList.append(rs)\n",
        "                    break\n",
        "\n",
        "        return finalEvalRewardsList"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "yhS8JP1s2fj_"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "episodes_dqn = 1000\n",
        "steps_per_episode = 200  # increase max steps per episode\n",
        "\n",
        "total_steps_cp_dqn = 0.3* episodes_dqn * steps_per_episode\n",
        "\n",
        "exp_wrapper_cp_dqn = DecayingEpsilonGreedy(\n",
        "    epsilon_start = 0.8,\n",
        "    epsilon_min   = 0.01,\n",
        "    decay_type    = 'exponential',\n",
        "    total_steps   = total_steps_cp_dqn\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "env_cp_dqn = gym.make('CartPole-v0')\n",
        "\n",
        "agent_cp_dqn = DQN(\n",
        "    env                        = env_cp_dqn,\n",
        "    seed                       = seed_all,\n",
        "    gamma                      = 0.99,\n",
        "    bufferSize                 = 50000,\n",
        "    batchSize                  = 64,\n",
        "    optimizerFn                = torch.optim.RMSprop,\n",
        "    optimizerLR                = 0.0005,\n",
        "    MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES         = episodes_dqn,\n",
        "    MAX_EVAL_EPISODES          = 1,\n",
        "    explorationStrategyTrainFn = exp_wrapper_cp_dqn,\n",
        "    explorationStrategyEvalFn  = selectGreedyAction,\n",
        "    updateFrequency            = 20\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
